    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ8eYMJtiLaS4RpOiKeaXUJGc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OTldXZHdaM2RMZEdNd2NpMWxPR05uY0RKWWJYYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "First time coming here, ordered hojicha latte and their signature toast. I would say so-so. Never tried other menu so cant really judge. But pretty instagrammable place, with many seating options.\nBetter come here with many people like family and friends (solo seating options arent as many)\nService was great. They were clear and communicative.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "First time coming here, ordered hojicha latte and their signature toast. I would say so-so. Never tried other menu so cant really judge. But pretty instagrammable place, with many seating options.\nBetter come here with many people like family and friends (solo seating options arent as many)\nService was great. They were clear and communicative.",
