    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ8eYMJtiLaS4RpOiKeaXUJGc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGd2F6WlZUalZoVDNGV1ZrNVJhbm81ZG5wNGMzYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I love with this place, It feels warm, cozy and really comforting, all staff really friendly and helpful amd they can help you to choosw what you gonna have when you confuse what to eat or drink. So i choose their signature toast was such a fun surprise. It’s unique and when I paired it with the caramel coffee.. blends so perfectly...\nNot that only,I also tried the Spaghetti Bolognese Brûlée and it was satisfied me, it's meaty, creamy and super satisfying. I had it with the Soul Sister drink, and they matched so well!\nOverall, I had a really good experience here. Good food, good vibes, good drinks. I would love to comeback again!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
